# A play-by-mail game of 1st Manassas (BULLRUN1.CIV). PBM Game, Begin NEW: the Confederate
# player rests every unit for nine turns, and the game writes SAVEGAME.PBM for the other player.
# PBM Game, Continue: the file is decoded and its checksum checked, and the Union player rests
# every unit for nine turns; the game writes the file again. The PBM menu has no title of its
# own: it shows the main menu's, so it waits at 2:M too. It checks the file written last.
#! seed 7
#! timeout 600
#! files SAVEGAME.PBM

rule 1 key space
rule 5 key space
rule 2:C key enter
rule 2:P key enter
rule 2:S key enter

# PBM Game, four down from Load File; Begin NEW PBM Game.
play until 2:M
repeat 4
key down
prompt
end
key enter
prompt
digest
key enter

# The file list: BULLRUN1.CIV; then the main menu, without Parameters; Fight.
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key right
prompt
key enter
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
play until 5
digest
key space

# Nine turns later the game writes the PBM file and goes back to the main menu.
play until 2:M
digest

# PBM Game, Continue PBM Game; Fight as the Union side.
repeat 4
key down
prompt
end
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
play until 5
digest
key space
play until 2:M
digest

# Quit, Yes.
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
